  "_id": "index-deliver",
  "content": [
    {
      "text": "the Lord makes those he has chosen mighty unto power of deliverance, 1 Ne. 1:20. the Lord will deliver Laban into brothers’ hands, 1 Ne. 3:29. the Lord is able to deliver us, 1 Ne. 4:3. the Lord delivers people of Lehi1 from destruction in Jerusalem, 1 Ne. 17:14. temporal and spiritual deaths must deliver up their dead, 2 Ne. 9:11–12. God delivers his Saints from awful monster of death, 2 Ne. 9:19. mercy of God in eternal plan of deliverance from death, 2 Ne. 11:5. book shall be delivered unto a man, 2 Ne. 27:9–22. Zeniff’s people are awakened to remembrance of deliverance of their fathers, Mosiah 9:17. Resurrection of dead according to deliverance of Christ from bands of death, Alma 4:14. the Son blots out transgressions according to power of his deliverance, Alma 7:13. righteous shall reap salvation according to deliverance of Christ, Alma 9:28. give us strength according to our faith in Christ, even unto deliverance, Alma 14:26. Alma2 and Amulek relate their power of deliverance to those cast out of Ammonihah, Alma 15:2. Nephites’ great rejoicing because of deliverance by hand of the Lord, Alma 46:7. the Lord causes that Nephites hope for deliverance in him, Alma 58:11. we trust God will deliver us, Alma 58:37. deliver us from evil, 3 Ne. 13:12 (Matt. 6:13).",
